``` Fake base station / IMSI catcher
    Many DIFFERENT subscribers fail the MAC check in the same cell
    within 5 minutes. One phone failing could be a broken SIM, but 5+
    different phones in one place means something there is pretending
    to be the network.
    Threshold: 5 distinct subscribers per cell per 5 minutes. ```
index=fiveg source="traffic.jsonl" event_type=auth_failure cause=MAC_FAILURE
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count dc(subscriber) as subscribers by _time cell
| where subscribers >= 5
